node_modules/
dist/
# `var/` is a fossil: no directory of that name has ever existed here. The
# runtime state actually lives in native/var-<who>/, which this did not match,
# so ~16,000 lines of telemetry were committed before anyone noticed.
# Learned world knowledge (market-*.json) stays TRACKED on purpose - it is 4KB
# a character and losing it costs a full town trip to rediscover. The ledgers
# and the rally file are pure runtime and are not.
native/var-*/spend.jsonl
native/rally/leader.json
.env
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.pi/npm/
rust-harness/target/
.fastembed_cache/

# The template, on purpose: it holds names, never values.
!.env.example

# A world snapshot holds other players sessions, positions and packs.
state-snapshot-*.json
